      "Replication": "Disabled",
      "Description": "Allows for DesignScript code to be authored directly",
      "Code": "//work out the number of perimeter parking spots per setout curve.\nperimeter_parking_number =\n(setout_line_length / parking_bay_width);\n\n//the required number of perimeter parking setout points.\nperimeter_parking_point_number =\nperimeter_parking_number + 1;"
